SmartStock Inventory Management System
=====================================

## Project Overview
SmartStock is an AI-powered inventory management system designed for retail and pharmacy businesses. It features user roles, product and supplier management, sales and purchase tracking, AI-driven demand forecasting, and an integrated AI assistant.

---

## Entity Relationship Diagram (ERD)

![ERD Diagram](ERD.png)

---

## Entities and Relationships

### 1. CustomUser
- Fields: username, role (Admin/Manager/Cashier), phone, avatar
- Relationships: Creates StockMovements, Sales, PurchaseOrders, ChatHistory

### 2. Category
- Fields: name, description, icon
- Relationships: Has many Products

### 3. Supplier
- Fields: name, contact, address, email, city
- Relationships: Supplies Products, Receives PurchaseOrders

### 4. Product
- Fields: name, barcode, description, tags, category, supplier, purchase_price, selling_price, unit, min_stock, reorder_point, current_stock, expiry_date, batch_number, embedding_json, last_reorder_qty, image
- Relationships: Belongs to Category and Supplier, Has many StockMovements, SaleItems, PurchaseOrderItems, and one ForecastResult

### 5. StockMovement
- Fields: product, movement_type, quantity, balance_after, unit_price, notes, created_by, created_at, reference
- Relationships: Linked to Product and User

### 6. Sale
- Fields: invoice_number, customer_name, customer_phone, total_amount, discount, paid_amount, status, cashier, notes, created_at
- Relationships: Has many SaleItems, Linked to User

### 7. SaleItem
- Fields: sale, product, quantity, unit_price, total_price
- Relationships: Linked to Sale and Product

### 8. PurchaseOrder
- Fields: po_number, supplier, status, total_amount, ordered_by, notes, expected_delivery, created_at, received_at
- Relationships: Has many PurchaseOrderItems, Linked to Supplier and User

### 9. PurchaseOrderItem
- Fields: order, product, quantity_ordered, quantity_received, unit_cost, total_cost
- Relationships: Linked to PurchaseOrder and Product

### 10. ChatHistory
- Fields: user, session_id, role, message, created_at
- Relationships: Linked to User

### 11. ForecastResult
- Fields: product, forecast_dates_json, forecast_values_json, recommended_reorder, model_used, mae, generated_at
- Relationships: Linked to Product

---

## Main Forms (Apply/Implementation)

### User Registration Form
- Fields: username, email, role, password1, password2

### Product Form
- Fields: name, generic_name, description, tags, barcode, category, supplier, purchase_price, selling_price, unit, min_stock, reorder_point, current_stock, expiry_date, batch_number, image

### Category Form
- Fields: name, description, icon

### Supplier Form
- Fields: name, contact, email, address, city

### Stock Adjustment Form
- Fields: movement_type, quantity, notes

